1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,420
This is a picture of me at rock bottom.

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,260
It was Christmas Eve,

3
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,760
I was living at my girlfriend's parents' house

4
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,640
in their extra bedroom.

5
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,200
And I'm the guy she just met on the internet

6
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,760
that just quit her job for it,

7
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,880
that just lost everything.

8
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,680
My business partner took all the money I had made

9
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:11,600
from selling my gyms,

10
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,500
and I just found out the $100,000 that I put in

11
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:15,820
to launch this new business

12
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,840
was getting held up by the processor,

13
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,200
and I had to pay all my bills

14
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,720
and sent my last payment,

15
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,800
leaving only $1,000 left in my bank account.

16
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,680
And I was like, I think you should leave me.

17
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,380
I think I'm a sicken ship right now,

18
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:27,960
and I respect you.

19
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:29,840
We're cool if you wanna walk away,

20
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,320
and I would walk away from you right now.

21
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,040
She pulled my chin towards hers,

22
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:34,720
and she said I would sleep with you

23
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,840
on her bridge to Canada.

24
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:37,560
If you find a girl who believes in your dreams

25
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:38,480
more than you do,

26
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:40,200
who makes you wanna be a better man,

27
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,280
who's willing to work alongside you to get there,

28
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:44,200
and is grateful for whatever you have today,

29
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,160
just marry her.

30
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,200
Because at the end of the day,

31
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,560
your spouse marries two people,

32
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,500
the person you are and the person you're gonna become.

33
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,800
Make sure they love both.

